Source: vchord
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, libicu-dev,
 clang-21 | clang-20 | clang-19 | clang-18 | clang-17 | clang-16,
 libclang-21-dev | libclang-20-dev | libclang-19-dev | libclang-18-dev | libclang-17-dev | libclang-16-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://vchord.pgsty.com/

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-vchord
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-vchord
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, postgresql-PGVERSION-pgvector
Description: Scalable vector search in PostgreSQL
 VectorChord provides scalable, disk-efficient vector similarity search
 and is the successor to pgvecto.rs. This package uses the PGSTY fork.
